+## REQ-LEARN-5544: Cross-Model SOTA CSL Transfer Behind Five-Arm Gate
+
+The Exp5544 workflow SHALL write
+`results/experiment_5544_cross_model_sota_csl_transfer.json` only after loading
+`results/experiment_5543_retrieval_warmed_csl_five_arm_ablation.json` and
+confirming `csl_five_arm_ready=true`. The workflow SHALL test whether
+retrieval memory generated by one mandated local SOTA GGUF model family improves
+another mandated local SOTA GGUF model family without changing model weights.
+When runtime permits, the workflow SHALL select at least one Qwen MoE family
+model and at least one Gemma family model from
+`unsloth/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-GGUF`, `unsloth/gemma-4-31B-it-GGUF`, and
+`unsloth/gemma-4-26B-A4B-it-GGUF` through `cached_sota_pair()` or the current
+local-GGUF resolver pattern, and SHALL NOT call
+`AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained` for a GGUF repository.
+
+The experiment SHALL build external memory from source-model attempts and then
+evaluate target-model held-out queries under no-memory, shuffled-memory,
+same-family aligned-memory, and cross-family aligned-memory arms. Source and
+target prompts SHALL record prompt hashes and output hashes. The evaluation
+SHALL report whether stale evidence is rejected, whether negative transfer is
+accepted, whether GPU/offload evidence is clean, and whether before/after
+model-file receipts prove no weight mutation. Legacy small GGUFs MAY be used
+only for CPU smoke tests and SHALL NOT contribute to headline transfer scores.
+
+The artifact SHALL include required fields `model_specs`, `source_models`,
+`target_models`, `no_memory_score`, `shuffled_memory_score`,
+`same_family_memory_score`, `cross_family_memory_score`,
+`cross_family_delta_over_shuffled`, `heldout_delta`, `no_weight_mutation`,
+`stale_evidence_rejection_rate`, `negative_transfer_rate`, `random_seed`,
+`measured_duration_s`, `gpu_offload_evidence`, `csl_claim_allowed`,
+`tests_added_or_reused`, `field_principles`, `inference_substrate`, and
+`honest_verdict`. It SHALL set
+`inference_substrate="live_local_sota_gguf_cross_model_csl"`. It SHALL set
+`csl_claim_allowed=true` only when the upstream five-arm gate is clean,
+cross-family aligned memory beats both shuffled-memory and no-memory controls,
+held-out delta is positive, stale evidence is fully rejected, negative-transfer
+acceptance is zero, GPU/offload evidence is present, and no model weights
+mutated.
+
+### REQ-LEARN-5544 Sub-requirements
+
+- REQ-LEARN-5544-1: The workflow SHALL fail closed when Exp5543 is missing,
+  unreadable, or does not report `csl_five_arm_ready=true`.
+- REQ-LEARN-5544-2: `model_specs` SHALL list the mandated SOTA GGUF IDs,
+  family, role, quantization, command/helper path, local file receipt, and
+  runtime/offload receipt for every headline model considered.
+- REQ-LEARN-5544-3: Source attempts SHALL record source model, target memory
+  family, prompt hash, output hash, selected answer, verifier acceptance, and a
+  receipt that the attempt updated only external retrieval memory.
+- REQ-LEARN-5544-4: Target evaluations SHALL score the same held-out query IDs
+  under no-memory, shuffled-memory, same-family aligned-memory, and
+  cross-family aligned-memory arms.
+- REQ-LEARN-5544-5: `cross_family_delta_over_shuffled` SHALL equal
+  `cross_family_memory_score - shuffled_memory_score`, and `heldout_delta`
+  SHALL equal `cross_family_memory_score - no_memory_score`, rounded
+  deterministically.
+- REQ-LEARN-5544-6: `csl_claim_allowed` SHALL remain false unless
+  cross-family memory beats shuffled and no-memory controls, stale evidence is
+  fully rejected, negative transfer is zero, GPU/offload evidence is clean, and
+  no model-file receipt changed.
+
+### SCENARIO-LEARN-5544-UPSTREAM-GATE: Five-Arm Gate Must Be Clean
+
+**Given** the Exp5543 five-arm ablation artifact exists
+**When** Exp5544 evaluates preconditions
+**Then** it SHALL record the upstream path, loadability, `csl_five_arm_ready`
+value, and whether the cross-model transfer claim may proceed.
+
+### SCENARIO-LEARN-5544-CROSS-FAMILY: Cross-Family Memory Beats Controls
+
+**Given** source-model attempts have produced verifier-accepted external
+memory from one SOTA GGUF family
+**When** a target model from another SOTA GGUF family evaluates held-out queries
+under no-memory, shuffled-memory, same-family memory, and cross-family memory
+arms
+**Then** `cross_family_delta_over_shuffled` and `heldout_delta` SHALL be
+positive before `csl_claim_allowed` can be true.
+
+### SCENARIO-LEARN-5544-NO-WEIGHT-MUTATION: Transfer Is External-Memory Only
+
+**Given** source and target models have local GGUF file receipts before the run
+**When** source attempts and target evaluations complete
+**Then** model-file receipts SHALL match after the run, no adapter or training
+write SHALL be reported, `no_weight_mutation` SHALL be true, and any positive
+transfer claim SHALL be attributed only to external retrieval memory.
+
